            {
              "content": "=You are the social media SEO strategist for [Your Brand], a premium technology brand.\n\nAnalyze the following image analysis and create platform-specific content.\n\nIMAGE ANALYSIS:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n\nGenerate:\n1. Instagram: 3 captions, SEO keywords, relevant hashtags, and a CTA.\n2. LinkedIn: 3 professional captions, industry keywords, relevant hashtags, and a discussion CTA.\n3. YouTube: 3 searchable titles, 3 descriptions, relevant search keywords, video tags, and hashtags.\n\nKeep every caption factually accurate to the source. Do not invent technical specifications or claim that keywords are trending without live research.\n\nReturn valid JSON with separate instagram, linkedin, and youtube objects.\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object.\nDo not use Markdown code fences.\nDo not include ```json or ``` in the response.\nThe first character must be { and the last character must be }."
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
